[[Legendary Sigil]]s are [[upgrade component]]s that, once socketed, have the power to take on the properties of any other superior [[sigil]]. Both [[Legendary Rune|legendary runes]] and sigils can be removed from [[equipment]] of any rarity without needing to use an [[Upgrade Extractor]].

A maximum of 8 legendary sigils can be added to an account's [[Legendary Armory]], enough for all land and aquatic [[weapon]] sets. Despite being a legendary item, they have no unique visual effects.

== Lore ==
{{Legendary unlock text|"I believe that sigils contain fragments, or memories, from the greatest battles in [[Tyria (world)|Tyria]]'s history," Lady Nari wrote. "This one may be our only window into the Battle of the [[Three Queens]]."}}

